{"synopsis":"Frey Raon Starlight adalah pahlawan yang membunuh keluarga dan rekan-rekannya dan menghancurkan dunia. Tujuannya adalah untuk kembali ke masa lalu, membuka “rute tersembunyi” untuk benar-benar menyelamatkan dunia, dan mencapai kedamaian.\n\nSesuai rencana, ia berhasil kembali ke masa lalu dan mendapatkan akses ke rute tersembunyi. Namun, kelegaannya berumur pendek karena ia dihadapkan dengan kebenaran yang tak terduga: lima pahlawan yang ia bunuh dalam kehidupan sebelumnya telah mempertahankan ingatan mereka dan sekarang berusaha membunuhnya …!\n\nBisakah Frey, dalam keadaan ekstrem seperti itu, menyelamatkan dunia saat ini?","alternative_title":"I'm a Hero, but the Heroines Are Trying to Kill Me, 勇者ですが、ヒロインたちに命を狙われています, 메인 히로인들이 나를 죽이려 한다","author":"RAL, Kim Mamo","artist":"Yeonjin Jeong","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"159c8a19-3b5d-4fc6-bd7e-ff6c65e7ca35","number":"46","chapter":"46","title":"","date":"2026-04-26","released":"2026-04-26"},{"chapter_id":"97e965d3-7ed1-42d0-8725-9aa8af917e8c","number":"45","chapter":"45","title":"","date":"2026-03-21","released":"2026-03-21"},{"chapter_id":"502e5503-a96c-4bc9-b116-9c91551e5d1d","number":"44","chapter":"44","title":"","date":"2026-03-14","released":"2026-03-14"},{"chapter_id":"c15f64ee-85eb-4a60-808a-1952708c0924","number":"43","chapter":"43","title":"","date":"2026-03-05","released":"2026-03-05"},{"chapter_id":"17f8586f-9243-496a-adb8-79a95cf00698","number":"42","chapter":"42","title":"","date":"2026-02-26","released":"2026-02-26"},{"chapter_id":"b7d8035c-b71e-4154-82ad-94e6c6bd2276","number":"41","chapter":"41","title":"","date":"2026-02-25","released":"2026-02-25"},{"chapter_id":"fa74882c-2ed0-467d-9db3-d3b91bb733e4","number":"40","chapter":"40","title":"","date":"2026-02-12","released":"2026-02-12"},{"chapter_id":"2c69d3d2-00e6-46ee-881d-cce06bb7c7db","number":"39","chapter":"39","title":"","date":"2026-02-08","released":"2026-02-08"},{"chapter_id":"4ab8bb12-4085-4da6-a03d-4a3b9334649a","number":"38","ch